# ==================================================
# AI Proxy Rules - 精准综合版
# FORMAT: Clash / Mihomo Classical Ruleset
# ==================================================
#
# 包含：
# Microsoft Copilot / GitHub Copilot
# Anthropic / Claude
# Google Gemini / AI Studio / NotebookLM
# Google Jules / Flow / Opal / Antigravity / Stitch
# OpenAI / ChatGPT / Sora
# xAI / Grok
# Meta AI
# Perplexity
# Groq
# Dify
# Genspark
#
# 设计原则：
# 1. 优先使用服务专属域名，减少误分流
# 2. 不使用整个 googleapis.com / gstatic.com / x.com / bing.com
# 3. 不加入 Sentry / Stripe / Intercom / Datadog 等共享第三方域名
# 4. 尽量避免普通 Google / X / Bing 流量进入 AI 策略组
# 5. Google 登录仅保留 accounts.google.com，提高 Gemini / NotebookLM 会话地区一致性


# ==================================================
# Microsoft Copilot / GitHub Copilot
# ==================================================

DOMAIN,location.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,odc.officeapps.live.com
DOMAIN,copilot-proxy.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,copilot-workspace.githubnext.com
DOMAIN,copilotprodattachments.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoft.net
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoftapp.net
DOMAIN,sydney.bing.com

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.microsoft.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.microsoftapp.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bing-shopping.microsoft-falcon.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,edgeservices.bing.com


